OL,3,GNEWSANew summer music event aims to
OL,4,Aboost town's economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cricket club is hoping to bring more
OL,7,Fvisitors to the town by hosting a new
OL,8,Fannual summer music event.
OL,10,FSomerset County Cricket Club has teamed
OL,11,Fup with entertainment company Full Fat
OL,12,F360 to launch Somerset Sounds, an
OL,13,Fannual summer music event starting next
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,16,FOrganisers say it will attract major
OL,17,Finternational artists and bring more
OL,18,Fvisitors, jobs and money into the local
OL,19,Feconomy.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
