OL,3,GNEWSANew summer music event aims to
OL,4,Aboost town's economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FCaroline Herbert, commercial director
OL,7,Fat Somerset County Cricket Club, said:
OL,8,F"We're kind of starved of music.
OL,9,FObviously, Glastonbury is a fantastic
OL,10,Fevent but outside of that, we want to
OL,11,Fmake Taunton famous for putting on live
OL,12,Fmusic."
